The Pharaoh was divine and a depositary of absolute power. He was above all and accountable to none.

c0044
00:10:00.000 --> 00:10:11.140
Within such a system, no laws or rights can be truly operative. As the great Egyptologist

c0045
00:10:11.140 --> 00:10:19.940
John A. Wilson remarked, the authority of codified law would have competed with the

c0046
