c0055
00:12:06.100 --> 00:12:35.994
The first monotheistic formula in biblical literature He referred to God as the Most High God Creator of Heaven and Earth Thereupon Abraham adopted this formula and used it when giving an oath to the king of Sodom

c0056
00:12:35.994 --> 00:12:46.994
This formula is highly significant. As we shall see, it expresses Egyptian ideology.

c0057
00:12:46.994 --> 00:13:00.754
The term Qone that we translated Creator means also Possessor, Master. The meaning is clear.

c0058
00:13:00.754 --> 00:13:11.234
God, as the Creator of the Universe, is also its absolute Master and Possessor. Within

c0059
00:13:11.234 --> 00:13:22.754
In the Egyptian culture prevailing in Canaan at that time, this means that God is the Pharaoh of the universe.

c0060
00:13:22.754 --> 00:13:38.354
It seems that the only viable alternative to Mesopotamian relativism was Egyptian totalitarianism.

c0061
00:13:38.354 --> 00:13:47.234
It must have been a very sad moment when later into the day Abraham realized the ultimate

