It means to count or calibrate something within a definite frame or figure.

c0101
00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:30.720
American scholarship, particularly in the fields of linguistics and anthropology, have pointed out how the culture in which one lives affects the sensory perception of the individual.

c0102
